SOLUTION 0  Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
SOLUTION 1-10
    -pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
SOLUTION 11  Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 11
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -punch_frequency 1
    -print_frequency 1
END
